kinocut/engine_audio_bed.py) in internal/controlplane/videos/compose/bed.go,
and the voice's gain under a true-peak ceiling, the mix of voice and bed and
the measured output (kinocut/engine_audio_normalize.py,
kinocut/engine_audio_normalize_output.py, kinocut/engine_audio_mix.py) in
internal/controlplane/videos/compose/music.go.
